&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Regional Marketing Manager, you will own regional marketing for the sales team in your territory and set the standard for how the regional team plans and runs its work. You will choose, plan, and run the events and campaigns that create, expand, and accelerate pipeline in your region, and you will move easily between high-level strategy and creative, detailed execution. Staff is a leadership-level individual contributor role: you lead through the work you build and ship, not through direct reports. In a modern marketing organization, that means building and running your own plans, programs, measurement, and AI-assisted automation instead of handing them off, and it suits builders who are comfortable being a leader without a team to manage. Your audience is CIOs, CTOs, VPs of engineering and platform, and the security leaders who govern how their teams ship software. You will judge audience quality by seniority and buying role, not headcount, so you will need to understand how they work and what they want from a vendor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support both direct and channel sales teams, work with GitLab partners on Channel and Alliance Marketing activities, and partner with external agencies and third parties to prepare and run campaigns. As a senior individual contributor, you will mentor other regional marketers, help build and improve team process, and share best practices with regional peers by planning and operating transparently. Your impact is measured in pipeline: the target is 10X spend contribution to sales pipeline for your region, with your regional budget spent within 5% variance. This role supports one of our sales regions (AMER, EMEA, or APAC), and involves travel up to 50% of the time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive results for your region as its marketing leader: own the pipeline and growth outcomes, and go beyond events and experiences to bring partners in to drive marketing across channels, in support of growth through our revenue team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt digital and content marketing programs to the needs of your regional sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, expand, and accelerate sales opportunities through regional and account-focused campaigns that promote GitLab’s products and services, within the marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set regional event and campaign strategy, with discretion over which events and campaigns best support regional sales goals, and manage events onsite, including logistics, booth staffing, and swag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage every campaign from start to finish, following the GitLab process, so each one meets its objectives, arrives on time, and stays within budget, then measure and report on its effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional work to drive demand generation and regional marketing plans, and advocate for your sales region within marketing and for marketing with your sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Channel and Alliance Marketing activities with GitLab partners, from campaign approval through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with external agencies and third parties to prepare, manage, and execute campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide regional marketing specialists and managers, and lead in building and driving process within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and execute&amp;nbsp; a regional strategy, with a record of delivering, accelerating, and expanding sales pipeline through regional marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting both direct sales and channel sales teams, and in enterprise solution demand creation and regional marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exemplary analytical skills and a proven aptitude for using data to optimize program performance and inform future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with a proven ability to convey ideas and data clearly in writing and in presentations to a variety of audiences, without a fear of over-communicating. You plan and operate transparently and share best practices with other regional marketers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven aptitude for building and driving a budget within your territory, and extreme attention to program details and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The capacity to empathize with CIOs, CTOs, VPs of engineering and platform, and the security leaders who govern how their teams ship software, and a passion for, and substantial understanding of, the developer tools, IT operations tools, and/or IT security markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use GitLab, and you share our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/values/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt; and work in accordance with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 50% and to comply with the company’s travel policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regional Marketing at GitLab turns marketing strategy into regional action. We support our sales teams in AMER, EMEA, and APAC by running the events and campaigns that build pipeline in their territories, working with direct sellers, channel sellers, and alliance partners. We work closely with Product Marketing, Corporate Events, Digital Marketing, Marketing Operations, Developer Relations, Business Development, Customer Success Managers, and Solution Architects. Our goals are set through the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/okrs/&quot;&gt;Marketing OKRs&lt;/a&gt; and measured in pipeline contribution and regional budget. To see how the role fits in the team and where it can lead, read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/job-description-library/marketing/field-marketing-manager/&quot;&gt;Regional Marketing Manager job family&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/job-description-library/marketing/director-field-marketing/&quot;&gt;Regional Marketing leadership&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$139,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$235,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Flight Dynamics Engineer, you will work in a small team of dedicated engineers responsible for the Flight Dynamics and Mission Planning for Planet’s fleet of satellites. The Flight Dynamics disciplines of this team include mission design, orbit determination, maneuver design and execution (with propulsion and differential-drag), and conjunction assessment &amp;amp; mitigation. Mission Planning is concerned with optimal scheduling of imaging and contacts for Planet’s Dove, SkySat, Pelican, and Tanager constellations. This operations research problem has a direct impact on fulfilling the business needs for the world’s largest heterogeneous constellation of Earth Observation satellites. Your role will involve developing and automating tools to assess mission design trade-offs that will define the future of Planet&#39;s constellations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, design, and architect new software solutions for managing Mission Design needs for Planet&#39;s increasingly diverse fleets of satellites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on complex optimization problems with your knowledge of flight dynamics and software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and automate tools to assess mission design trade-offs that will define the future of Planet&#39;s constellations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with mission planning, flight dynamics, and ground software teams to improve the operations of existing fleets and enable future missions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform first-principles analysis to optimize scheduling of imaging and contacts for Planet&#39;s diverse satellite constellations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Aerospace Engineering, physics or related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in orbital mechanics and space mission operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in software development, in C++ and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience carrying out first-principles analysis and operationalizing MVP solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal technical communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with constellation and mission design trade studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing one or more of the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orbit determination and high-fidelity propagation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Covariance realism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-thrust mission design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maneuver automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constellation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining peer-reviewed code, attention to quality including automated testing, and continuous integration and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Center Preconstruction &amp;amp; Capacity Delivery Manager at Anthropic, you&#39;ll make sure our EMEA deals are ready to execute before we commit to them, and you&#39;ll take time out of every program before the lease is signed. Delivery dates and costs on AI infrastructure deals are largely fixed at signature. What is missed before then is hard to recover afterwards, and our leverage over the schedule is at its highest while the deal is still open.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;About 75% of your time goes to preconstruction and pre-lease management, from first desktop review through Letter of Intent (LOI) to lease execution. You&#39;ll test whether each opportunity can be delivered, rigorously accelerate its program, and shape the deal so that what a developer commits to can be held to, verified and delivered.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The other 25% goes to delivery. You&#39;ll carry that work through mobilization, embed with the partners building leased and partnered capacity, and lead them to deliver on the fastest possible schedule while maintaining a safe construction site and protecting the finished quality of the data center.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our EMEA pipeline is getting off the ground, so you&#39;ll set the standard for how deals become ready for execution here. This role offers a unique opportunity to shape how Anthropic secures and activates the compute infrastructure needed to train and deploy frontier AI systems, working at the intersection of real estate, construction, and cutting-edge AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities - preconstruction and pre-lease management (about 75%):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead. &amp;nbsp;This is a role where leadership trumps management and process. &amp;nbsp;You will be expected to engage developers, contractors, utilities and our transaction teams early enough to shape the outcome of each deal rather than report on it afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Confirm deal readiness and serve as the gatekeeper to validate transaction viability from LOI through lease execution, ensuring all predevelopment, planning, technical and business requirements are met before commitment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give transaction leads an early delivery view from desktop study on capacity, power, permitting, connectivity, schedule and cost, so that the sites moving to LOI are ones that can be delivered&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run independent, evidence-based delivery due diligence on each opportunity, tested against source documents rather than relayed claims, covering capacity, power, permitting, connectivity, procurement, schedule, cost, and whether the developer&#39;s team, contractors and supply chain can deliver&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interrogate every developer schedule from the native file rather than summary dates, testing logic, durations, production rates and critical paths, planning backwards from commissioning, and establishing the unconstrained date before any commercial protection is added&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rigorously accelerate programs during the pre-lease phase by making schedule work a priority for the developer while the deal depends on it, pulling forward design, permitting, power, early works and procurement, and sequencing the build around how capacity turns up&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Assess contractor and supply-chain capacity and long-lead equipment needs for each opportunity, setting a long-lead strategy that secures delivery capacity ahead of need and making the case for early equipment funding where it protects a date&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Challenge Total Development Cost and delivery schedules against the assumptions behind Yield-on-Cost and IRR, flagging where time-to-power or cost exposure puts the investment case at risk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shape the delivery terms of the LOI, lease and supporting exhibits with transaction and legal teams, including phasing and target dates, landlord scope, diligence cost, ownership and reliance, risk allocation and governance, and check that the developer&#39;s contract with its general contractor carries the same milestones and aligns incentives around accelerated delivery&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give deal and delivery leadership a clear go/no-go recommendation at each decision point up to signature, with the risks, conditions and mitigations behind it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Keep one delivery-readiness record and one risk register across all EMEA opportunities, assigning every risk to an accountable owner, tracking it to resolution, and escalating where cost or schedule is threatened&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Direct owner&#39;s representatives and third-party advisers and assure what they produce, bringing design and engineering, cost, schedule, commercial, contracts and procurement into a single view of risk and readiness&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop and refine the preconstruction playbook, a reference log of unit costs and benchmarks, and the operating model needed to scale the function, using AI tools including Claude for first-pass assessment, document review and benchmarking so your time goes to judgment and negotiation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prepare and present regular executive reporting on readiness and risk for each opportunity and across the portfolio, including time from signature to construction start, risks found before versus after signature, and baseline-to-actual variance, supporting forward capacity planning and strategic decision-making&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities - delivery leadership (about 25%):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Document the baseline at signature for design, budget, schedule, long-lead position, open risks and conditions, so delivery starts from an assured position whether you carry the project forward yourself or hand it to a delivery colleague&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with landlords and developers post-deal to serve as Anthropic&#39;s primary point of contact, coordinating across internal stakeholders, tracking construction progress, and facilitating critical information exchange between development partners and Anthropic stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will be expected to be at one or more project sites in adequate amount to shape the culture, approach, and aggressiveness that define those extended site teams. The goal is to impact outcomes in a favorable manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are expected to be a force multiplier that develops and enhances the skillset that development partners, contractors, and key trades bring to the project(s) you are overseeing. &amp;nbsp;That means being a subject matter expert in the various cross functional elements of data center delivery and increasing the team&#39;s performance with that knowledge and commitment to alignment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic in key technical and operational decisions required by partners during the development process, ensuring our infrastructure requirements are met while maintaining strong partnerships&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive seamless handoffs to operational state with heavy focus on engagement across networking and deployment teams, enabling rapid workload turn-ups and minimizing time-to-production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify and mitigate risks throughout the delivery lifecycle, proactively addressing blockers that could impact timeline, cost, or technical requirements, and feed what you learn on site back into diligence and the playbook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have 8+ years of experience in preconstruction, development, or cost and commercial management on data center or other large mission-critical programs within EMEA, including time leading delivery on site. &amp;nbsp;You won&#39;t have a big direct team to delegate to but will instead be able to treat the entire cross functional organizations around each deal and jobsite as your team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of testing developer and contractor claims on cost, schedule, power and permitting against source documents, and of telling a deal team when a date does not hold up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have taken time out of programs before construction started, and can show how. &amp;nbsp;You read a native schedule fluently and know which levers in design, permitting, power and procurement move a date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have shaped delivery terms in development, lease or construction agreements, working with legal teams, and have led tendering and bid analysis. &amp;nbsp;You understand how cost and schedule flow through to the investment case.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a strong understanding of the end to end (dirt to delivery) data center development process to include entitlements and permitting, planning and supply chain, execution, commissioning, and handover. You are not an administrator but an active player in the arena comfortable making decisions without the need to consult across multiple external parties.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You should understand the nuances of data center design and construction across EMEA markets- who the players are, how power and permitting differ, what contractual norms get in the way of speed of delivery, how teams can be incentivized to build and deliver faster than normal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have built or scaled a team or function, including directing third-party advisers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this role you will often be on an island and responsible for your own destiny. &amp;nbsp;You will have free rein to develop your own approaches with the mission guidance being your only bounds. &amp;nbsp;No one will be there to empower your efforts, you will create your own influence by building relationships and diving in at all phases to deliver success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You must thrive operating with ambiguity and have a willingness to own outcomes, knowing that the buck stops with you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a bonus if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Understand AI/ML infrastructure requirements, including high-density power and advanced cooling systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have had preconstruction or leadership positions (Preconstruction Manager, General Superintendent, Project Manager) within a GC, EPC or developer on hyperscale data center projects or in self performance of hyperscale data center development projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prioritize extreme ownership and have the ability to create winning cultures across diverse teams and job sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are deeply familiar with lease negotiations, construction contracts, or real estate development processes and have strategies to move those arrangements from traditionally transaction and risk managed arrangements to collaborative efforts that align incentives around accelerated delivery of facilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have secured long-lead equipment or manufacturing capacity ahead of a signed deal, including through frame agreements or early funding arrangements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have run quantitative schedule risk analysis, or built parametric cost benchmarks across a portfolio of sites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Speak additional European languages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£1 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll (Working Student)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the team&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, our People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team is the engine behind a smooth and reliable employee experience. We manage the full employee lifecycle — from onboarding and contract changes through to offboarding — while supporting accurate and timely payroll across Southern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In France, recurring operational work is growing across employee lifecycle administration, field sales hiring and payroll coordination. You’ll join a hands-on, detail-driven team where operational excellence and employee care go hand in hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Working Student position supporting the People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team in France. You’ll take ownership of recurring administrative and payroll support tasks, help keep our data accurate and up to date, and make sure employees and managers get timely, clear support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great entry point into HR and payroll operations for someone who is organised, reliable, and eager to build real expertise in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payroll support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to collect, and organise payroll input data ahead of monthly deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support follow-up with external payroll and benefits providers where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain accurate payroll records and flag missing information or discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HR administration &amp;amp; employee lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, update, and archive employment contracts and employee documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding, contract changes, and offboarding processes — ensuring data accuracy and completeness at every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with benefits administration where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee support &amp;amp; ticket handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to routine employee and manager queries via internal systems and email with clarity and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage open tickets and follow up, escalating more complex cases when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data management &amp;amp; process improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update employee data in HR systems and Excel / Google Sheets trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular data checks and keep Notion pages and internal documentation up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive steps, data-quality issues, or bottlenecks in recurring workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest small process improvements that make day-to-day operations more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in HR, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English — clear written and verbal communication is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy, especially with sensitive employee and payroll data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Excel / Google Sheets skills and confidence working with structured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — able to manage recurring tasks and meet regular deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling confidential information with discretion and good judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to learn new tools and systems — we work across multiple HR platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a hands-on, service-oriented attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Previous experience or studies in HR, payroll administration, or people operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interest in payroll processes, HR systems, or process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Familiarity with AI tools such as ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why SumUp?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎&amp;nbsp; Work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Barcelona office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈&amp;nbsp; Be part of a workplace that values diversity and inclusion, where every perspective is respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;❤️&amp;nbsp; Access our Employee Assistance Programme for mental health guidance and support when you need it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Product Manager – Finanzierung &amp;amp; Integrationen (m/w/d)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die meisten Product-Rollen geben dir ein Backlog und ein Engineering-Team. Diese gibt dir zusätzlich einen Verhandlungstisch: Du überzeugst die Produktteams von Banken, ihr eigenes Engineering-Budget in eine Anbindung zu stecken. Danach gehört dir die Schnittstelle – auch nach dem Go-live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standort:&lt;/strong&gt; Zentral in Berlin – Du arbeitest vor Ort in unserem Büro, hybrid mit 3 Tagen Office und 2 Tagen Homeoffice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Über uns&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CarOnSale ist die KI-gestützte Plattform für den B2B-Gebrauchtwagenhandel in Europa. Über 40.000 Käufer aus mehr als 20 Ländern handeln auf unserer Plattform – und 85 % des Inventars ist exklusiv bei uns. Wir verbinden Software, Pricing-Intelligenz, Logistik und Finanzierung in einer Schicht – als Betriebssystem für eine ganze Branche.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;One Platform. One Profit Engine.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verantwortest die Anbindung unserer Finanzierungs- und Bankpartner – von der Anforderung über die Umsetzung mit Engineering bis zum Betrieb nach dem Go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du überzeugst die Produktteams unserer Partner, eigenes Engineering-Budget in die Integration zu investieren, und führst diese Gespräche bis zur Entscheidung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du analysierst, wo Händler zwischen Fahrzeugansicht und abgeschlossenem Gebot abspringen, und erhöhst die Conversion messbar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du ziehst deine Daten selbst, begründest jede Priorisierung damit und verfolgst die KPIs deiner Features nach dem Launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du baust Prototypen, um eine Idee zu testen, bevor du Engineering-Zeit dafür einplanst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sprichst regelmäßig mit Händlern, sammelst Feedback strukturiert ein und übersetzt es in konkrete Anforderungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Stelle ist eine Nachbesetzung in einer gewachsenen Produktorganisation – acht Product Manager, zehn Engineering-Teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Was du mitbringst&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6 Jahre im Produktmanagement in einem digitalen B2B-, Plattform- oder E-Commerce-Umfeld, mit breitem Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine Funnel- oder Conversion-Kennzahl bewegt und kannst Ausgangswert und Ergebnis nennen – mit Daten, die du selbst gezogen hast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit externen Partnern, deren Prioritäten du verstehen und beeinflussen musstest – nicht nur interne Stakeholder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technisches Verständnis für API-Integrationen: Du musst nicht selbst entwickeln, aber verstehen, worüber Engineering spricht&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine klare Vorstellung davon, wo KI diese Arbeit konkret besser macht – ob dein aktueller Arbeitgeber dir die Tools zur Verfügung stellt, spielt für uns keine Rolle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutsch auf C1-Niveau, Englisch verhandlungssicher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Von Vorteil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit einer zweiseitigen Plattform – du hast für Angebot und Nachfrage gearbeitet, nicht nur für eine Seite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Checkout-, Payment- oder Finanzierungsprozessen (z. B. BNPL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Berührungspunkte mit dem Automotive-Umfeld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du nicht brauchst:&lt;/strong&gt; Erfahrung im Banking oder Fintech. Die Finanzierungswelt lernst du hier – das Gespür für Partner bringst du mit.&lt;/p&gt;
