&lt;p&gt;Looking to kickstart your career and make a global impact? Join Ocado Group’s Graduate Programme and become a driving force in the future of technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start Date: Early September 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 2 years (Fixed-term, full-time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Hatfield, Welwyn Garden City and London (hybrid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ocado Group delivers innovative technology solutions powered by the latest advancements in automation, robotics, machine learning, and artificial intelligence, catering to the online grocery and non-grocery distribution sectors. With over 20 years of experience in the online grocery industry and a portfolio of patented technologies, we strive to transform the economics and service standards of grocery ecommerce on a global scale.&amp;nbsp;A workplace culture that celebrates diversity, collaboration, and creativity.&amp;nbsp;Discover more about Ocado Group’s story &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ocadogroup.com/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our rotation scheme is designed to give you first-hand experience of a range of areas from Bot Software to Data Science. As a graduate, you will rotate through multiple departments during the two year scheme in four different six-month placements, giving you a well-rounded understanding of the business. You&#39;ll work in teams across the Ocado Group division, gaining knowledge and insight into the vast number of challenges. Once you’ve successfully completed the programme, you can look forward to a long-term career with a huge amount of scope and knowledge from across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are some of the areas you could be working in on the scheme:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bot Software &amp;amp; Hardware:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds next-generation bot systems and prototypes cutting-edge robotics solutions to enhance fleet reliability and performance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;eCommerce:&lt;/strong&gt; Powers the Ocado Smart Platform&#39;s global web and native mobile apps, delivering high-scale search, personalization, and seamless shopping experiences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt;: Develops the low-latency control systems, warehouse management software, and high-performance GUIs that drive highly automated warehouses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Drives cross-stream ML, data engineering, and advanced warehouse simulations to optimize control algorithms and test hardware before physical rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates typically have degrees related to (but not limited to) Computer Science, Physics, Mathematics, AI, Robotics, Machine Learning etc. but we consider candidates from a wide range of academic backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a real passion for quality coding and cutting edge technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a logical thinker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embody a collaborative approach to projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don’t be afraid to think outside of the box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: This role does not qualify for Skilled Worker Sponsorship and requires full right to work in the UK for the full duration of the programme.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online Application: Share your background and client-facing career ambitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video Interview: Introduce yourself and showcase your communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online Tests: Demonstrate your numerical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessment Centre: Collaborate with peers on real-world scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here&#39;s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more - and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support:&lt;/strong&gt; Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE), and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle to Work Scheme and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
